; prices and pricedb parse the composed --limit exactly as every other
; report does.  "()" alone is an empty expression, which limits nothing;
; the error cases are in prices-limit-empty-term-errors.test.
2024/01/01 Buy AAPL
    Assets:AAPL        1 AAPL @ $10
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Buy MSFT
    Assets:MSFT        1 MSFT @ $20
    Assets:Cash

test prices -l '()'
2024/01/01 AAPL              $10
2024/01/02 MSFT              $20
end test
